    "title": "Public hearing regarding grant money was held at Jasper City Hall on Tuesday - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Steve W Stewart ,\n1 days ago A public hearing regarding grant money was held at Jasper City Hall on Tuesday evening. The hearing was in regard to the City of Jasper applying for a $2 million grant from the Texas General Land Office for recovery funds related to a 2024 storm that struck the area, and also for a $1 million grant from the Texas Department of Agriculture for sidewalk repair and improved lighting in downtown Jasper. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
